      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"docs/api/Zaya.TranslatorCache.Services.ITranslatorCacheService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Pluggable translation-cache engine. Hosts discover implementations, bind\n<xref href=\"Zaya.TranslatorCache.Services.ITranslatorCacheService.Settings\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>, then wrap a raw <xref href=\"Zaya.Translator.Services.ITranslatorSession\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>\nvia <xref href=\"Zaya.TranslatorCache.Services.ITranslatorCacheService.WrapSessionAsync(Zaya.Translator.Services.ITranslatorSession%2cSystem.Collections.Generic.IReadOnlyDictionary%7bSystem.String%2cSystem.Object%7d%2cSystem.Threading.CancellationToken)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>.</p>\n"
